---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Project Umbra">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-intro about-intro">
      <h1>Behind the<br />research.</h1>
      <p>An independent group investigating software supply chains and memory safety with agentic LLM systems and manual review.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="reading-layout about-layout">
      <nav class="reading-nav" aria-label="On this page">
        <p class="nav-title">About Umbra</p>
        <a href="#mandate">Mandate</a>
        <a href="#policy">Disclosure policy</a>
        <a href="#team">Team</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="about-sections">
        <section id="mandate" class="about-section">
          <h2>The mandate</h2>
          <p>An AI security experiment. For the background, see <a href="https://cooties.io/blog/project-umbra/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Project Umbra</a>.</p>
          <p>Findings are published here only once the vendor has had a chance to fix.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/">Read the disclosed research <Arrow /></a>
        </section>
        <section id="policy" class="about-section">
          <h2>Coordinated disclosure</h2>
          <p>We report issues privately to the affected vendor and give them <strong>90 days</strong> to ship a fix before anything is published. The clock starts on first contact.</p>
          <p>If a vendor responds quickly, asks for more time in good faith, or the issue is already being exploited in the wild, we adjust the timeline accordingly. Technical detail stays embargoed until disclosure.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="team" class="about-section">
          <h2>The team</h2>
          <ul class="team">
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joechegne/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eu Joe <Arrow direction="external" /></a><span>Model, evals, pipeline</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/supertsumu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Damien Wong <Arrow direction="external" /></a><span>Triage, manual review (former)</span></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/the-olivier-gagne/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Olivier Gagné <Arrow direction="external" /></a><span>Triage, manual review (former)</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
